            boss.dialog.sentence(self,"image:【XY-魔理沙04","right","一般来讲在神社也能听到确实不太可能ZE",600)
            boss.dialog.sentence(self,"image:【XY-魔理沙04","right","也就是说，还有谁在搞鬼吗？",600)
            boss.dialog.sentence(self,"image:【XY-灵梦01","left","大概是了",600)
            boss.dialog.sentence(self,"image:【XY-灵梦07","left","不过现在我比较想回到神社睡觉……",600)
            boss.dialog.sentence(self,"image:【XY-灵梦08","left","先说好，你可不要又先跑去调查",600)
